INSERT INTO `teams` VALUES (23,'Angel Cabra','Mortgage Administration Assistant','angel@equifirst.aecheck','uploads/teams/1756110538_TOOL6g.jpg','With a strong background in finance, wealth management services, and mortgage processes, Angel supports Equifirst’s operations with structure, precision, and efficiency. Her ability to streamline workflows and ensure compliance contributes to smoother transactions for clients and the team. Angel’s commitment to operational excellence and client service helps Equifirst deliver reliable, transparent, and professional mortgage experiences, keeping processes aligned with both client needs and business objectives.','2025-08-25 08:28:58','2025-08-25 09:00:43','uploads/teams/1756110538_TOOL6g.jpg'),(24,'Centhia Cortez','Team Coordinator Supervisor','centhia@equifirst.ae','971 52 211 2599','Centhia has built a rewarding career as a Mortgage Team Coordinator Supervisor, refining processes to enhance both efficiency and client satisfaction. Over the past few years, she has streamlined workflows, optimized systems, and improved transition points across the mortgage journey. Her focus on operational excellence ensures smoother client experiences and reliable outcomes, reinforcing Equifirst’s promise of seamless, transparent, and client-centered mortgage solutions.','2025-08-25 08:35:36','2025-08-25 08:35:36','uploads/teams/1756110936_FXl0GO.jpg'),(25,'Adeliia Mulloiarova','Mortgage Advisor','adeliia.ova@equifirst.ae','971563224449','Adel specializes in guiding clients through tailored mortgage solutions with professionalism and care. With a strong understanding of financing structures and the UAE property market, she helps residents and international buyers navigate their options with confidence. She focuses on simplifying the process, securing the most suitable terms, and ensuring clients feel supported at every stage. Her client-first approach and attention to detail make her a trusted partner for anyone seeking clarity in their property financing journey.','2025-08-25 08:39:21','2025-08-25 08:39:21','uploads/teams/1756111161_OyFzjA.jpg'),(27,'Sara Nanakalei','Mortgage Advisor','sarah.n@equifirst.ae','uploads/teams/1756113142_LVEDTj.jpg','Sara provides personalized mortgage advisory services with a strong focus on transparency and client success. She supports both residents and international investors, simplifying the mortgage process and securing competitive terms. With her approachable style and practical expertise, Sara helps clients make informed decisions with confidence. Her ability to understand client priorities and translate them into effective financing solutions ensures a seamless journey from inquiry to ownership.','2025-08-25 09:12:22','2025-11-17 10:53:08','uploads/teams/1756113142_LVEDTj.jpg'),(28,'Isak Matti','Mortgage Advisor','isak@equifirst.ae','971527232788','With over 18 years of experience in finance, sales, and business development, Isak brings unmatched expertise to mortgage advisory. His career spans operations management, product strategy, and customer relationship management, giving him a deep understanding of complex financial processes. Skilled in driving performance and streamlining solutions, Isak ensures clients benefit from both efficiency and value. His ability to analyze needs and deliver tailored financing options positions him as a strategic guide in achieving long-term property goals.','2025-08-25 09:14:07','2025-08-25 09:14:07','uploads/teams/1756113247_sxLfN8.jpg'),(32,'Ines Boudinar','Digital Marketing Manager','ines.b@equifirst.ae','uploads/profiles/WmJQym9WGHERiw5ZXeHCpmY8f2hiDKZfhIulUnxl.jpg','Ines leads Equifirst’s digital presence with precision and creativity. Holding a master’s in Digital Marketing and over 4 years of hands-on experience, she blends strategy with innovation to generate high-quality leads and measurable results. With a sharp eye for trends and a commitment to clarity, Ines ensures Equifirst stays ahead in a fast-evolving digital landscape, delivering campaigns that connect, engage, and drive growth.','2025-08-25 17:58:51','2025-08-27 07:05:34','uploads/teams/1756144731_R915SO.jpg'),(33,'Manan Law','Managing Partner','manan@equifirst.ae','1234567','Manan brings over 15 years of banking experience in the UAE, covering both private and commercial banking. Having managed more than AED 1 billion in mortgages, he combines market insight with proven results. His leadership ensures Equifirst delivers strategic solutions with speed, transparency, and reliability. Based in Dubai, Manan focuses on guiding clients through complex financing with confidence. His extensive expertise and client-first philosophy make him a trusted partner in navigating the UAE’s dynamic property market.','2025-08-25 17:59:42','2025-08-25 17:59:42','uploads/teams/1756144782_lFyHJ8.jpg');
/*!40000 ALTER TABLE `teams` ENABLE KEYS */;
UNLOCK TABLES;

